# 📈 Real-Time Stock Market ETL Pipeline

> Incremental Data Engineering Pipeline using **Alpha Vantage API → PySpark → PostgreSQL → Docker**

<br>

## 🚀 Overview

This project demonstrates an end-to-end ETL pipeline that:

* Extracts stock market OHLCV data from Alpha Vantage API
* Processes data using PySpark
* Implements Medallion Architecture (Bronze → Silver → Gold)
* Loads analytics-ready data into PostgreSQL
* Uses incremental loading to avoid duplicate records
* Runs entirely inside Docker containers

