## 🔄 Incremental Load Strategy

```text
checkpoint.json
       │
       ▼
Fetch recent data
       │
       ▼
Extract from API
       │
       ▼
Left Anti Join
(Remove existing rows)
       │
       ▼
Load PostgreSQL
       │
       ▼
Update checkpoint
```

### Duplicate Prevention Layers

| Layer          | Strategy              |
| -------------- | --------------------- |
| Extraction     | Date Window Filtering |
| Transformation | Spark Left Anti Join  |
| Database       | Composite Primary Key |

